WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Chun-Li uses raw Drive Rush toward the knocked-down Juri.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.150
Crouching medium kick starts after the Rush approach.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.150
The crouching medium kick counter-hits Juri on wake-up.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.550
Both characters recover after the low check.
